# UI guidelines

Before changing markup, classes, or theme behavior, read @.context/ui-guidelines.md.

- Prefer Beer CSS semantic elements and utilities over custom CSS or extra component libraries.
- Cards: `<article className="border round">` or surface-container card wrappers.
- Layout: `grid` with `s12 m6` columns; page content in `<main className="responsive">`.
- Icons: `<i>home</i>`, `<i>inventory_2</i>`, `<i>settings</i>`, `<i>checkroom</i>`.
- Theme: `ui('mode', 'dark' | 'light')` from `beercss`.
- Interactive controls need ≥48px tap targets.
